# OpenMerc MENU-SCRATCH: rows of the video page (m_video.rmf, <omtable>).
# UTF-8; the engine picks EN or RU by the menu language (om_language).
# kind    | cvar | values | labels EN | labels RU | label EN | label RU | flags
# kind    | cvar | min | max | step | label EN | label RU | flags         (slider)
# section | EN | RU | flags      note | EN | RU | flags      rmf | raw RMF
# flags: stage (menu_* cvar staged until Apply, menus/video.cfg + applyvid.cfg),
#        requires=cvar (row hidden while the cvar is not registered),
#        tip=EN/RU
# Renderer effects add their rows in the EFFECTS block; rows of cvars the
# running renderer does not register stay hidden.

# RLabs (play-test 2026-11-05 "I would prefer 3 graphics settings and thats it"): one Graphics
# choice and the few things a player sets - nothing else graphical. Individual effects stay in the config file and
# console for testing (engine/src/client/cl_graphics.c writes them for the chosen setting).
section | DISPLAY | ЭКРАН | tip=Display settings are applied with the Apply button/Настройки экрана применяются кнопкой Применить
list | menu_fullscreen | 2,0 | Full Screen,Window | Полный экран,В окне | Display | Экран | stage
list | r_graphics | 0,1,2 | Performance - 120 fps,Quality - 60 fps - best looks,Battery - 60 fps - saves power | Производительность - 120 fps,Качество - 60 fps - лучшая картинка,Батарея - 60 fps - экономия | Graphics | Графика | tip=Performance is smooth at 120 fps. Quality shows every effect at 60 fps. Battery is lighter at 60 fps./Производительность - плавные 120 fps. Качество - все эффекты при 60 fps. Батарея - легче при 60 fps.
list | r_perfhud | 0,1 | Off,On | Выкл,Вкл | Performance HUD | Монитор производительности | requires=r_perfhud | tip=Apple's Metal Performance HUD: frame rate, frame times, GPU time and memory (Mac)/Монитор производительности Metal от Apple: частота кадров, время кадра, время GPU и память (Mac)

section | VIEW | ОБЗОР
list | menu_fov | 75,80,85,90,95,100,105,110 | 75,80,85,90,95,100,105,110 | 75,80,85,90,95,100,105,110 | Field of View | Поле зрения | stage
slider | menu_brightness | 0 | 1 | 0.1 | Brightness | Яркость | stage

section | SIZE | РАЗМЕР
list | menu_hudscale | 0,1,2,3,4 | Auto,1x,2x,3x,4x | Авто,1x,2x,3x,4x | HUD Size | Размер HUD | stage
list | scr_textscale | 1,1.25,1.5,2,2.5,3 | 100%,125%,150%,200%,250%,300% | 100%,125%,150%,200%,250%,300% | Text and Subtitle Size | Размер текста и субтитров | tip=Console text and on-screen messages and subtitles/Текст консоли и сообщений на экране и субтитры
